      "text": "## Five Modes of Pre-Technical Knowing"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-SAGE-FRAME.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-SAGE-FRAME.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
