        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Volume 6 Diamond - History and Ideas II",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Every technical discipline in the other fifty-one volumes has an ancestor here. Not a primitive ancestor — a structural one. The pre-technical is not the pre-rational. It is the first rationality: the one that had to work before instruments existed."
    },
    {
      "id": "00-SAGE-FRAME.md#008",
      "path": [
        "00-SAGE-FRAME.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:anthropology:00-sage-frame, git-history:anthropology:00-sage-frame]",
        "canonical_path": "anthropology/00-SAGE-FRAME.md",
