        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Volume 6 Diamond - History and Ideas II",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "These five modes are not sequential. They are concurrent. Every human society, from the first stone tools forward, was simultaneously organizing, reasoning, narrating, sanctifying, and leaving material traces. The Sage reads all five registers at once."
    },
