        "title": "Volume 6 Diamond - History and Ideas II",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Sacred geometry (mythology/religion)   ──→  Architecture\n  Temple proportions (Vitruvius)       ──→  Structural engineering\n  Mandala cosmograms                   ──→  Urban planning grids\n  Feng shui spatial orientation        ──→  Environmental design"
